4. Added proper padding and height to the container
5. Removed the ErrorBoundary since we're now providing the necessary data
6. Structured the mock data to match what the component expects based on its implementation

The mock data follows the structure expected by the LineChart component, with:
- Month as the index
- Values for all the required categories (Created, Completed, Rescheduled, etc.)
- Realistic sample values

This should resolve the error by providing the necessary data structure that the component is trying to map over.

